    "research-index": "<div class=\"sc-repo-grid\"><div class=\"sc-repo-list\"><div class=\"sc-repo-item\"><div class=\"sc-article-card\"><h2 class=\"sc-section-heading\">Practical AI Adoption in Sub-Saharan Africa: Procurement, Local Adaptation and the Productivity Opportunity</h2><p>Artificial intelligence is reaching African workers, firms and public institutions before the foundations for dependable use are evenly in place. The immediate opportunity is not to reproduce a frontier-model race. It is to procure and adapt task-specific tools that work with local languages, trusted data, affordable access and accountable institutions. This paper examines how Sub-Saharan African governments and investors can turn early adoption into productivity while keeping implementation risk visible.</p><p style=\"display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:0;\"><a href=\"https://stonecomms.com/sdg/sdg-8-decent-work-and-economic-growth\" title=\"SDG 8: Decent Work and Economic Growth\" aria-label=\"SDG 8: Decent Work and Economic Growth\" style=\"width:34px;height:34px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border-radius:3px;background-color:#A21942;color:#fff;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;text-decoration:none;\">8</a><a href=\"https://stonecomms.com/sdg/sdg-9-industry-innovation-and-infrastructure\" title=\"SDG 9: Industry, Innovation and Infrastructure\" aria-label=\"SDG 9: Industry, Innovation and Infrastructure\" style=\"width:34px;height:34px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border-radius:3px;background-color:#FD6925;color:#111;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;text-decoration:none;\">9</a><a href=\"https://stonecomms.com/sdg/sdg-16-peace-justice-and-strong-institutions\" title=\"SDG 16: Peace, Justice and Strong Institutions\" aria-label=\"SDG 16: Peace, Justice and Strong Institutions\" style=\"width:34px;height:34px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border-radius:3px;background-color:#00689D;color:#fff;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;text-decoration:none;\">16</a></p><a class=\"sc-link-inherit\" href=\"https://stonecomms.com/research/practical-ai-adoption-sub-saharan-africa-procurement-local-adaptation-productivity\">Read research →</a></div></div><div class=\"sc-repo-item\"><div class=\"sc-article-card\"><a href=\"https://stonecomms.com/research/border-inside-factory-africa-production-systems\" aria-label=\"African Trade Integration: Customs, Corridors, Power, Payments and Standards as a Production System\"><img class=\"sc-repo-thumb\" src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6a92be796568d7e2b4121557/6a947c73c99a4a52f180cf0e_ChatGPT%20Image%20Aug%2030%2C%202026%2C%2007_54_01%20PM.png\" alt=\"African regional production systems linking customs, corridors, power, payments and standards.\"></a><h2 class=\"sc-section-heading\">African Trade Integration: Customs, Corridors, Power, Payments and Standards as a Production System</h2><p>Africa has built the legal architecture for a continental market. The harder task is making the systems firms use every day work across borders. StoneComms tests that challenge against live reforms in East, West, Central and Southern Africa and finds a practical investment implication: regional infrastructure should be financed as an operating system, not a collection of assets.</p><p style=\"display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:0;\"><a href=\"https://stonecomms.com/sdg/sdg-8-decent-work-and-economic-growth\" title=\"SDG 8: Decent Work and Economic Growth\" aria-label=\"SDG 8: Decent Work and Economic Growth\" style=\"width:34px;height:34px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border-radius:3px;background-color:#A21942;color:#fff;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;text-decoration:none;\">8</a><a href=\"https://stonecomms.com/sdg/sdg-9-industry-innovation-and-infrastructure\" title=\"SDG 9: Industry, Innovation and Infrastructure\" aria-label=\"SDG 9: Industry, Innovation and Infrastructure\" style=\"width:34px;height:34px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border-radius:3px;background-color:#FD6925;color:#111;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;text-decoration:none;\">9</a><a href=\"https://stonecomms.com/sdg/sdg-16-peace-justice-and-strong-institutions\" title=\"SDG 16: Peace, Justice and Strong Institutions\" aria-label=\"SDG 16: Peace, Justice and Strong Institutions\" style=\"width:34px;height:34px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border-radius:3px;background-color:#00689D;color:#fff;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;text-decoration:none;\">16</a><a href=\"https://stonecomms.com/sdg/sdg-17-partnerships-for-the-goals\" title=\"SDG 17: Partnerships for the Goals\" aria-label=\"SDG 17: Partnerships for the Goals\" style=\"width:34px;height:34px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border-radius:3px;background-color:#19486A;color:#fff;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;text-decoration:none;\">17</a></p><a class=\"sc-link-inherit\" href=\"https://stonecomms.com/research/border-inside-factory-africa-production-systems\">Read research →</a></div></div></div></div>"
